Z||000001||86SE||11-04-2000||06:01 PM||||I had the same problem befor I parked my 86SE.  But i got closer to 150 miles per tank.  I have no idea what causes this but I shouldent have to worry about it anymore because a new engine is going in.<P>Side note....  After I took off the plenium, it is just caked with black/oily soot and smells like gas.  On the back of the throttle body it is about 16th to an 8th of an inch thick!<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero -- 3.4L CONVERSION IN PROGRESS --<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||1
